+
+**What to build:** A new copy added to a Title with waiting Holds goes straight to the Hold shelf for the oldest waiting Hold instead of onto the open shelf, so a Title never has a copy on the shelf while someone is waiting for it. See `.scratch/holds/spec.md`; use the vocabulary in `GLOSSARY.md`.
