+- [ ] Renewing an unknown loan id raises `LoanNotFound`.
+- [ ] Renewing a Loan that has been returned raises `RenewalRefused` and changes nothing.
+- [ ] A renewed Loan whose new due date hasn't passed no longer appears in `overdue_loans`.
