+# 03: A waiting Hold on the Title blocks renewal
+
+**What to build:** A Loan can't be renewed while anyone has a waiting Hold on its Title, so Members in the Hold queue get a copy as soon as one comes back. Ready Holds don't count, because those Members already have a copy set aside. See `.scratch/renewals/spec.md`; use the vocabulary in `GLOSSARY.md`.
+
+In `renew`, this check comes after the allowance and the Renewal window. The fixture's book Title has two copies, so a waiting Hold needs both out on loan; register extra Members in the test.
